    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13729" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσκοτ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>darken,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἐκείνου [θεοῦ] ἐνοράσεως ἑαυτὸν
					ἀπεσκότισε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Marc.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>remove darkness,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμικρὸν ἀποσκοτίσαι κελεύοντος</span>”
				<i>stand out of his light,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.605e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσκότησόν μου</span> is
				f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				6.38
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
